  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the creative sanctuary of Anvil Ink and Art, nestled in the heart of Fayetteville, where the eclectic beats of trashpolka and illustrative tattoos are masterfully crafted. Our doors are open daily from 11 am to 9 pm to both appointment seekers and spontaneous walk-ins, ready to welcome you into a realm where the finest ink is brought to life. Join us and be part of the vibrant tapestry of art that keeps Fayetteville boldly inked.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fayetteville, North Carolina, United States"
